# BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore automatically (docker build -f infra/watchdog/Dockerfile .)
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
packages/watchdog/.profiles
packages/watchdog/reports
packages/watchdog/blocklists
packages/warehouse/target
packages/warehouse/dbt_packages
packages/warehouse/logs
**/*.duckdb
**/*.duckdb.wal
